# MASTER BUILD PROMPT
# Unified AI Gateway — Personal Cloud AI Infrastructure

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a production-ready, cloud-hosted Unified AI Gateway inspired by the architecture and capabilities of OmniRoute and similar LLM routing platforms.

This is a personal AI infrastructure project. It will be used by one owner across multiple devices and AI development tools.

The primary goal is to create one centralized API gateway that connects multiple AI providers, supports custom provider configurations, combines providers into routing groups, and exposes unified APIs compatible with Claude Code and OpenAI-compatible clients.

The system must remain available when the owner's personal computer is turned off.

This is NOT a local-only application.

### Core Principles

- Cloud hosted and accessible 24/7, subject to hosting availability.
- One centralized API endpoint.
- One private owner account.
- Support many AI providers.
- Support custom OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic-compatible providers.
- Flexible routing and combination strategies.
- Claude Code compatibility is a first-class requirement.
- Secure provider credential management.
- Easy to extend with new providers.
- Clean, modern, professional dashboard.
- No unnecessary complexity or enterprise multi-tenant features.

